    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly presents this superb two-bedroom apartment, ideally positioned on Ringsend Road within a highly sought-after development. This attractive and light-filled home benefits from its own private door entrance and is set behind secure electronic gates, with residents enjoying beautifully maintained communal gardens to the front and rear, a bike store and a designated parking space. The interior is bright, modern, and thoughtfully laid out, comprising a spacious open-plan living, dining, and kitchen area, a welcoming hallway with hot press and bathroom, and two generously proportioned double bedrooms overlooking the communal gardens.\r\n\r\nThis excellent property offers a wonderful balance of privacy, comfort, and convenience in a highly desirable Dublin 4 location, within walking distance of Grand Canal Dock, Ringsend Village, Sandymount Strand, and a range of excellent amenities, cafés, and transport links.\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\n\r\nLocated moments from Grand Canal Dock, the city centre and Ballsbridge, this address offers exceptional convenience. Google’s European HQ is a short walk away, and public transport links are excellent, with Grand Canal Dock DART Station and multiple bus routes on the doorstep providing easy access across the city and to coastal suburbs. This vibrant neighbourhood offers an array of cafés, bars, restaurants, shops, and cultural attractions within walking distance. The Aviva Stadium, Bord Gáis Energy Theatre, and the IFSC are also nearby, making this an ideal choice for those seeking a prime Dublin location with every amenity close at hand."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living/Dining (3.99m x 4.08m)\r\nBright and open living/dining room with timber flooring, electric heating and open fire place.\r\n\r\nKitchen (2.31m x 1.71m)\r\nKitchen with tiled flooring & backsplash, appliances to include hob, oven, extractor fan, washing machine and fridge.\r\n\r\nHallway (2.77m x 0.83m)\r\n\r\nBathroom (1.94m x 1.91m)\r\nStylish bathroom with tiled walls and flooring, bath/shower unit, WHB, WC.\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (3.44m x 2.60m)\r\nDouble bedroom with built in wardrobe and south facing views of the communal rear garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (2.58m x 2.57m)\r\nDouble bedroom with built in wardrobe and south facing views of the communal rear garden.\r\n\r\nALL MEASUREMENTS ARE APPROXIMATE AND FOR GUIDANCE ONLY"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Superb two-bedroom apartment.\r\n\r\nOwn private door entrance.\r\n\r\nSecure, gated development.\r\n\r\nDesignated parking space.\r\n\r\nBright, light-filled interior.\r\n\r\nOverlooking beautifully maintained communal gardens.\r\n\r\nBike storage within the development.\r\n\r\nQuiet and well-maintained setting.\r\n\r\nPrime Dublin 4 location on Ringsend Road.\r\n\r\nWalking distance to Grand Canal Dock, Ringsend Village, Sandymount Strand and excellent transport links.\r\n\r\nService charge €1,074 p.a."
      },
      {
